## 6. QA Checklists

### 6.1 Blueprint QA (pass/fail)
- [ ] Header matches Section 2.2 (logo + `- LEVEL {N} | FULL LAYOUT CONCEPT -`)
- [ ] Zone count and left→right order match approved Content Spec
- [ ] Every zone has number, green ALL CAPS title, white tagline, dashed arrow to next
- [ ] Panorama is one continuous illustration (no panel grid)
- [ ] Boss arena at second-to-last zone; goal dumpster/bin at far right
- [ ] Legend items match approved spec (no extra mechanics)
- [ ] Footer copy matches approved spec verbatim
- [ ] Art style matches L1/L2/L6 reference tier
- [ ] Level-specific assets only (from `output/level{N}/`)

### 6.2 Level Concept QA (pass/fail)
- [ ] Header matches Section 3.2
- [ ] Exactly four panels in 2×2 grid with fixed titles from Section 3.3
- [ ] Each panel has number badge, subtitle, illustration, four-layer legend
- [ ] Layer asset lists match approved Content Spec
- [ ] Footer has design notes, material icons, tagline
- [ ] Art style matches L2/L4/L5 reference tier
- [ ] Level-specific assets only (from `output/level{N}/`)

