## 9. Non-Negotiables (Summary)

- Re-read this contract at the start of every conversation phase and every execution phase.
- Conversation before execution — no image generation without approved Content Spec.
- One deliverable per iteration (except C1: concept + blueprint as an explicit pair).
- Level 3 is always last (C1).
- Do not regenerate existing documents (Level 2 concept, Level 1/2/6 blueprints) unless user explicitly requests.
- No liberties with layout, copy, or mechanics — match reference documents and approved spec as closely as possible.
